<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S8.SS3.SSS0.Px1" title="In 8.3 Prompts ‣ 8 Appendix ‣ EvoEmo: Towards Evolved Emotional Policies for LLM Agents in Multi-Turn Negotiation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Prompts for both buyers and sellers</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
