</section>
<section id="S8.SS1.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">8.1.2 </span>Iteration Number</h4>

<div id="S8.SS1.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S8.SS1.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We also analyze the convergence properties of EvoEmo during evolutionary training (Table <a href="#S8.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 8.1.2 Iteration Number ‣ 8.1 More Experiments ‣ 8 Appendix ‣ EvoEmo: Towards Evolved Emotional Policies for LLM Agents in Multi-Turn Negotiation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>). The system shows progressive improvement through 3 iterations, with performance stabilizing after 5 iterations. This convergence pattern suggests that our evolutionary optimization effectively explores the strategy space while maintaining stable final performance.</p>
</div>
