<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S8.T3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="S8.T3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Performance of EvoEmo across training iterations.</span></figcaption>
