<section id="S8.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">8.2 </span>EvoEmo Algorithm</h3>

<div id="S8.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S8.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The EvoEmo algorithm, showned in Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ 8.2 EvoEmo Algorithm ‣ 8 Appendix ‣ EvoEmo: Towards Evolved Emotional Policies for LLM Agents in Multi-Turn Negotiation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, is an evolutionary optimization framework designed to learn optimal emotion transition policies for LLM-based negotiation agents. The algorithm maintains a population of emotion policies that evolve over generations through selection, crossover, and mutation operations. Each policy represents a sequence of emotional states that guide the buyer agent’s behavior during negotiation. The process begins with random initialization of emotion sequences and iteratively improves them by evaluating their performance in simulated negotiations between buyer, seller, and mediator agents. Policies are selected based on their negotiation success rewards, which consider deal acceptance, utility terms, and time efficiency. The best-performing policy emerges after multiple generations of evolutionary optimization, providing an emotionally intelligent strategy for effective multi-agent negotiations.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> EvoEmo: Evolutionary Emotion Optimization for Multi-Agent Negotiation</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
              
              
            LLM Agents: <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> (buyer), <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}_{2}</annotation></semantics></math> (seller), <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}_{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}_{3}</annotation></semantics></math> (mediator)

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
              
              
            Product description <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math>, initial prompts for buyer and seller

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
              
              
            Hyperparameters: population <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math>, generations <math id="alg1.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>G</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G</annotation></semantics></math>, max turns <math id="alg1.l3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{max}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>max</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{max}}</annotation></semantics></math>, initial temp <math id="alg1.l3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>, decay <math id="alg1.l3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
              
              
            Optimized emotion policy <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{\omega}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mi>ω</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\omega}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Initialization:</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
