            <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{0}\leftarrow\{\pi_{\omega}^{(1)},\pi_{\omega}^{(2)},\dots,\pi_{\omega}^{(m)}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mi>ω</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mi>ω</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mi>ω</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{0}\leftarrow\{\pi_{\omega}^{(1)},\pi_{\omega}^{(2)},\dots,\pi_{\omega}^{(m)}\}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l6.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Initialize population with random emotion sequences
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
